== About

Keyun Cheng is a Ph.D. candidate at [https://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/ Department
of Computer Science and Engineering], [https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/ The Chinese
University of Hong Kong]. He is a member of [http://adslab.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/
Applied Distributed System Lab] (ADSLab), supervised by Prof.
[https://www.cse.cuhk.edu.hk/~pclee Patrick P. C. Lee]. He received the B.Eng
degree in [https://cse.sysu.edu.cn/ Software Engineering] from
[http://www.sysu.edu.cn/ Sun Yat-Sen University] in 2018, the M.Sc. degree in
[http://msc.cse.cuhk.edu.hk Computer Science] from [https://www.cuhk.edu.hk/
The Chinese University of Hong Kong] in 2019. His research interests include
distributed storage systems and erasure coding. He maintains a
[https://keyuncheng.github.io/readings reading list].


== Education

- 2020.08 - Present: Ph.D. in Computer Science and Engineering, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2018.08 - 2019.07: M.Sc. in Computer Science, The Chinese University of Hong Kong
- 2014.08 - 2018.07: B.Eng in Software Engineering, Sun Yat-Sen University


